					<u>AJ</u>
					1.18.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				21.20
			</span></i>; 
				contr.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγῆ</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.310
			</span></i>.</div>
